      "type": "Narrative.Congressional.Statement",
      "data": {
        "quote": "I ran on a platform of fiscal sanity. This NDAA does not reflect fiscal sanity. We are adding nearly a trillion dollars per year to a military budget while our national debt accelerates past $37 trillion. I will not vote to bankrupt America in the name of defense.",
