        "title": "About H.R.2244",
        "text": "H.R.2244 authorizes $923 billion for defense in FY2027. It passed 218-210, with Massie among a small group of fiscal conservatives who crossed party lines to oppose the bill. Supporters argue the increase is necessary to counter China and Russia; critics point to rising national debt now exceeding $37 trillion.",
